sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Navbar as Navbar.jsx
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant Hook as useDocumentTitle.js
    participant View as View Component

    User->>Navbar: Click menu "About"
    Navbar->>App: onNavigate('about')
    App->>App: setActivePage('about')
    App->>App: Re-render

    App->>Hook: useDocumentTitle('About')
    Hook->>Hook: document.title = "OXIGEN | About"
    Hook->>Hook: window.scrollTo(0, 0)

    App->>View: Conditionally render <AboutView />

    Note over App,View: Props drilling:\nactivePage & onNavigate\npassed down as needed
